cards.content:
{% set e = 'weather.dwelldeck_slot_295' %}
{% set h = state_attr(e, 'humidity') %}
{% set w = state_attr(e, 'wind_speed') %}
{% set unit = state_attr(e, 'wind_speed_unit') or 'km/h' %}
### Current outdoor conditions
**Humidity:** {{ h ~ '%' if h is not none else 'Unavailable' }}  
**Wind speed:** {{ w ~ ' ' ~ unit if w is not none else 'Unavailable' }}

{% set ns = namespace(person=0, vehicle=0, active=[]) %}
{% for s in states.binary_sensor %}
  {% set label = (s.entity_id ~ ' ' ~ s.name) | lower %}
  {% if 'person' in label or 'human' in label or 'vehicle' in label or 'car detection' in label or 'intrusion' in label %}
    {% if 'person' in label or 'human' in label %}{% set ns.person = ns.person + 1 %}{% endif %}
    {% if 'vehicle' in label or 'car detection' in label %}{% set ns.vehicle = ns.vehicle + 1 %}{% endif %}
    {% if s.state == 'on' %}{% set ns.active = ns.active + [s.name] %}{% endif %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
### Detection status
**{{ ns.person }}** person/human sensors · **{{ ns.vehicle }}** vehicle sensors found by name

{% if ns.active | count > 0 %}
**Currently active:** {{ ns.active | join(', ') }}
{% else %}
**No matching detection sensor currently active.**
{% endif %}

_This automatically discovers named binary sensors; it does not confirm that cameras or notifications are online._

