### Latest detection state changes
{% set ns = namespace(count=0) %}
{% for s in states.binary_sensor | sort(attribute='last_changed', reverse=true) %}
  {% set label = (s.entity_id ~ ' ' ~ s.name) | lower %}
  {% if ('person' in label or 'human' in label or 'vehicle' in label or 'car detection' in label or 'intrusion' in label) and ns.count < 12 %}
- **{{ s.name }}** — {{ 'Detected' if s.state == 'on' else 'Clear' if s.state == 'off' else s.state }} · {{ as_local(s.last_changed).strftime('%d %b, %H:%M') }}
    {% set ns.count = ns.count + 1 %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if ns.count == 0 %}
No matching binary-sensor entities found yet. Check that Dahua detection entities have names containing **person**, **human**, **vehicle**, **car detection**, or **intrusion**.
{% endif %}

_This is the last state change for each sensor, **not a permanent event archive**. For repeated historical events, configure recorder/logbook or a dedicated notification automation._

